# RED Hydrogen One H1A1000 recovery USB bring-up.
# Stock .109 uses ConfigFS on the a800000.dwc3 controller.
# TWRP's generic init resets sys.usb.configfs to 0 during early-init,
# so restore the device-specific value during init before the fs trigger.
on init
    setprop sys.usb.controller a800000.dwc3
    setprop sys.usb.configfs 1
